{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqftffo7f2b","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Background-worker gate denial root cause is session-identity, NOT agent_tool_spawn — and exact leg behavior is still unconfirmed (needs live repro)","summary":"CORRECTION (2026-06-15) to my own earlier note: the claim \"agent_tool_spawn leg never fires\" is NOT the confirmed cause. The overlay self-register fallback (routes/overlay.js:87-99) DOES set agent_tool_spawn:true on a worktree-backed start_task claim. Verified against live state + code.\n\nCONFIRMED STRUCTURAL FACT: the orchestrator MCP server identifies its caller only by SESSION = process.env.ORCH_SESSION (mcp-graph.js:21), set ONCE at launch to the launching (main) session. A run_in_background Agent-tool worker issues MCP calls through that SAME server and has NO channel to convey its own harness session_id. So start_task records the claim under either the main session (mcp-core.js:244 default) or a value the worker fabricates — in the observed CE-1 case the worker invented session_id=\"ce1-worker-7a3f-session\". The PreToolUse gate (hooks/orch-gate.sh:43) queries /active-claim with the worker's REAL harness .session_id (a UUID). These three identities differ, so no /active-claim leg matches → is_subagent:false → main-session deny.\n\nEVIDENCE & ITS LIMIT: live agent registry shows ce1-worker-7a3f recorded under session \"ce1-worker-7a3f-session\"; /active-claim under that exact session returns claimed:false NOW — but task 1 has since been reset to ready by the stale-claim sweep (the worker died), so /active-claim (filters in_progress) would return empty regardless. The exact write-time leg behavior CANNOT be reconstructed from current state. A controlled live reproduction (worker probes /active-claim with its own session AT claim time) is required before trusting any specific fix.\n\nFIX DIRECTION (UNVALIDATED): give the worker's true harness session_id a path into start_task (dispatcher passes it in the handoff; worker forwards as session_id) so the recorded claim session == the gate's query session; OR add a daemon /active-claim leg that authorizes a worktree-backed claim by agent_id without session equality (weigh against the worktree-as-security-boundary invariant). D","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-15T22:59:32.503Z","vec":[-0.13643212616443634,0.016773032024502754,-0.01370669063180685,0.03149858117103577,0.04164871200919151,-0.045071788132190704,0.034823913127183914,0.01488483976572752,0.010433432646095753,0.09503347426652908,-0.005891948472708464,-0.02564810961484909,0.031493302434682846,0.00840469915419817,0.0025256099179387093,-0.015229725278913975,0.07661398500204086,-0.025474222376942635,-0.011948594823479652,-0.024706704542040825,0.06445953994989395,0.018809238448739052,-0.0004737084964290261,0.03060184046626091,-0.004375766962766647,-0.08142520487308502,-0.04451907053589821,-0.038866665214300156,0.009554388001561165,-0.03271041065454483,0.006711214780807495,0.07886422425508499,-0.11937481164932251,-0.08923904597759247,0.0865553691983223,0.07916106283664703,0.011571548879146576,-0.010451062582433224,-0.03716820478439331,0.0074605573900043964,0.0640118271112442,0.04377013072371483,-0.039849091321229935,-0.06891914457082748,-0.045167259871959686,0.015750478953123093,-0.04873977601528168,0.007889087311923504,-0.024090096354484558,0.002215953543782234,-0.0047905356623232365,0.002749550621956587,0.10096952319145203,0.044307589530944824,0.011933800764381886,0.004322837106883526,0.007114481646567583,0.0267344918102026,-0.04792099446058273,0.049634162336587906,-0.01594880409538746,-0.01182581391185522,-0.028236091136932373,-0.017171340063214302,0.02524515986442566,0.09973425418138504,-0.0022320880088955164,-0.06461580097675323,0.072526715695858,-0.012578031979501247,0.016981985419988632,-0.02988855168223381,-0.07632476836442947,-0.048595260828733444,0.019063560292124748,-0.020550895482301712,0.03120844066143036,0.015324181877076626,-0.007551178801804781,-0